  },
  "runtimeDependencies": [
    "AmigaOS 3.1 or later"
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Both stock executables match WBDock2/WBDock from the pinned publisher archive (2.907, 25 July 2023).",
    "The catalogue covers the Expansion/WBDock2 tree and its drawer icon, plus the WBStartup executable and icon. The accented paths retain their installed spelling.",
    "The wbex SDK helper keeps its upstream bytes and is installed in SDK. The upstream example icon targets sources:wbtest and is omitted.",
    "BCWB provides the active dock list, its simple pattern and the differing icons. The WBStartup icon loads SYS:Expansion/WBDock2/wbdock.config, whose second item targets SYS:Programs/DOpus/DirectoryOpus.",
    "LoadWB starts WBDock through WBStartup. The stock installer copies the payload without dock-specific actions. Directory Opus and its customized configuration remain in the directory-opus package."
  ],
  "developmentZipRemovals": [
    "Expansion/WBDock2/wbex.info"
  ],
